 "text": "Hello there, how are you? There's a gentle one that reads bedtime stories from roughly mid Harry Potter, so they stop at just the right point for pulling out the candle and going to bed. You might like it nicer and calmer. Do you want classics like Sleeping Beauty or something newer like A Wrinkle in Time? About half of two year olds do wake from one, so omni off it is. Sounds odd, but white noise can help too, if there's noise downstairs. Try turning it on and off a couple of times, instead of keeping it on all night. It gets weird when it's always on.",
